      "statement": "The 24K builds place both stacks growing down in a shared 0x5800-0x5FF0 window, leaving the return stack roughly 1,136 words before the end of the D16nano BIOS; D16SEG gives each stack its own segment.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://MEMMAP.md#L171-L182",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0c069459eaf1671fd5d04d17cd52d4a41db71a0b3c57d5b5172990f2d8f79dd7:"
