      "statement": "The 1 MiB screen build keeps the kernel from 0x0100, a dictionary ending at 0x4000, stacks near 0x6F00 and 0x7FF0, and a 2,000-word screen at 0xF1000 with character in the low byte and background/foreground attribute in the high byte.",
